timization"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-light border-l-2 border-brand-primary pl-6","children":"Re-engineered the entire supply chain visibility platform for a logistics giant, resulting in 30% faster delivery times."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute -bottom-1/2 -right-1/4 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-brand-primary/20 blur-[150px] rounded-full mix-blend-screen pointer-events-none"}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"py-20 md:py-32 relative","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-start","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:col-span-8 space-y-24","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-white","children":"Project Overview"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-lg prose-invert text-white/60 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"mb-6","children":"GlobalShip Networks is an internationally recognized leader in ocean freight and overland logistics. Operating across 15 time zones with a fleet of over 4,000 active vessels and trucks, their scale of operations is massive."}],["$","p","1",{"className":"mb-6","children":"However, operating at this scale using legacy systems created extreme friction. Data silos prevented regional managers from seeing the broader supply chain context, and manual data entry led to a rolling cascade of tracking errors that frustrated high-value enterprise clients."}],["$","p","2",{"className":"mb-6","children":"Logic-Unit was brought in as a strategic digital transformation partner to completely reimagine their visibility stack from the ground up."}]]}]]}],"$L3","$L4","$L5"]}],"$L6"]}]}]}],"$L7"]}],null,"$L8"]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
3:["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"p-8 md:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-white/5 border border-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors duration-500 relative overflow-hidden group","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute top-0 right-0 p-6 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity text-5xl","children":"⚠️"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-white mb-6","children":"The Challenge"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-white/60 text-lg leading-relaxed relative z-10","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":"The primary roadblock was a fragmented 15-year-old monolithic architecture. Real-time tracking was essentially non-existent; the system relied on batch updates that could be delayed by up to 12 hours. Communication between ports, vessels, and ground transport was disjointed, often relying on phone calls and spreadsheets."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"Furthermore, routing inefficiencies rooted in static algorithms were costing the company millions in wasted fuel and lost time. They needed an intelligent system capable of ingesting massive amounts of real-time IoT data and running predictive analytics to auto-adjust routes based on weather, port congestion, and fuel levels."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"p-8 md:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-brand-primary/10 border border-brand-primary/20 hover:bg-brand-primary/20 transition-colors duration-500 relative overflow-hidden group","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute top-0 right-0 p-6 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity text-5xl","children":"💡"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-white mb-6","children":"Our Solution"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-white/70 text-lg leading-relaxed relative z-10","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":"We architected a unified, cloud-native logistics platform leveraging AI-powered route optimization and real-time IoT sensor telemetry from their global fleet. We decoupled their legacy monolith into over 40 discrete microservices communicating via Apache Kafka event streams."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"The crown jewel of the new system was the 'Command Center'—a singular, hyper-responsive pane of glass built in React and WebGL. It allowed dispatchers to visualize the entire global fleet in real-time, click into individual vessels to read IoT telemetry (engine temperature, cargo humidity), and receive automated AI alerts when a logistics chain was at risk of failure."}]]}]]}]]}]
